{"1500740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Snail Simulator", "steam_appid": 1500740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [2901240, 3837000], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1500740/extras/6c273ef7455e9d49821866aad24b9e9f.avif?t=1783804564\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Now with hats!&quot;</i>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to the world's greatest Snail MMO! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever wanted to be a snail? Now you can be! Come along, bring a snail-y friend or two, and join us! </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore </strong>the vast (low poly) Snearth with Snail Friends!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join</strong> monthly Snail Parties! 🐌🐌🐌🥳🥳🥳🐌🐌🐌 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MMOS</strong> (Massive Multiplayer Online Snails)!  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SaaS</strong> (Snails as a Service)!  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wear</strong> a hat (or not, this is <i>your simulation</i>)!  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>BECOME</strong></i> a snail (in a simulation)!  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Join</strong></i> a (sluggishly) growing community!  <br>Link to Discord is on the right-hand side!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will there be <strong><i>Slug DLC???</i></strong> (yes! it's available now!)!   </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Thanks so much for the feedback from our feedback forms!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I am surprised at how fun that game is for how slow paced it is!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I have almost 60 hours and am still enjoying all the fun stuff the dev does. He is so active i